+  'Wishes for Eyes of Blue': {role: 'starter', does: 'Discard 1: add a Level 1 LIGHT Tuner and a Spell/Trap that mentions Blue-Eyes White Dragon by name (Roar, True Light, Majesty - not Mausoleum of White). From the GY: equip a Blue-Eyes from the Extra Deck to Blue-Eyes White Dragon (+400; turns on Tyrant Dragon). One effect each per turn.', links: {search: ['Maiden of White', 'Sage with Eyes of Blue', 'Lunar Rabbit Omajinai', 'Roar of the Blue-Eyed Dragons', 'True Light', 'Majesty of the White Dragons']}},
