+/* r34 arena polish (Claude, 23 Oct 2026; Kevy 10:18: "Master Duel level ... rehaul visuals"). Presentation only:
+   no game rules, no AI. Our own styling; no Konami UI or logos.
+   1. Field cards fill their zone (they were drawn at about half the zone height) and lift off the mat.
+   2. Defence Position cards lie sideways again on the tablet stage.
+   3. ATK / DEF read as a small chip on the card instead of a strip under it.
+   4. Outside Learn pace, phase changes and draws are a slim ribbon on the midline instead of a full-board banner (turn changes stay big).
+   5. Calmer mat: empty zones lose the hazard stripes (corner marks and a soft glow stay), so the cards stand out.
+   6. Gold aura (Kevy 13:04): in Play / Control-both modes every card you can use right now (summon, activate, attack,
+      or chain - e.g. Ash Blossom in hand during their combo) glows gold and pulses. Was a thin green outline.
+   7. Legal-zone outlines (where a card may be placed) only show when a person is choosing (ChatGPT RELAY-022 #5): in
+      AI duels they looked like an unanswered prompt.
+   8. Quick Pause / One action buttons beside Skip FX (ChatGPT RELAY-022 #9). */
+
+/* 1-3 */
+body.in-duel.tablet-stage #duel .zone.occupied>img{inset:2px!important;width:calc(100% - 4px)!important;height:calc(100% - 4px)!important;
+ filter:drop-shadow(0 5px 7px rgba(0,0,0,.6))!important;transition:transform .25s ease}
+body.in-duel.tablet-stage #duel .zone.occupied>img{background:none!important}
+body.in-duel.tablet-stage #duel .zone.occupied.defence[data-slot*=":4:"]>img{transform:rotate(90deg)!important}
+body.in-duel.tablet-stage #duel .zone.occupied .zone-caption{opacity:0}
+body.in-duel.tablet-stage #duel .zone.occupied .card-stats{position:absolute!important;left:50%!important;right:auto!important;bottom:3px!important;top:auto!important;
+ transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:3;margin:0!important;padding:1px 8px!important;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap;
+ background:rgba(6,8,20,.86)!important;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--zone-color,#7aa7ff) 70%,#fff);
+ font:800 11px/1.35 var(--font-ui)!important;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#fff!important;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}
+body.in-duel.tablet-stage #duel .zone.occupied .card-stats.stat-changed{background:#ffd21a!important;color:#0b0b10!important}
+
+/* 4 */
+body[data-pace]:not([data-pace=learning]) #event-stage.live:is([data-kind=phase],[data-kind=draw]){background:none!important;box-shadow:none!important;border:0!important;pointer-events:none}
